{"title":"Career Roadmap · Urban Landscape Designer","role":"Urban Landscape Designer","summary":"An Urban Landscape Designer plans and designs outdoor environments within cities, integrating landscape, ecology, public space, mobility, climate resilience, water management and human activity.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Urban Landscape Designer plans and designs outdoor environments within cities, integrating landscape, ecology, public space, mobility, climate resilience, water management and human activity."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Arch graduate, the strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Architecture","Landscape Design","Urban Planning","Ecology","Public Realm","GIS","Climate-Responsive Design"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The role can involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public-space design"},{"text":"Urban parks"},{"text":"Streetscapes"},{"text":"Plazas"},{"text":"Greenways"},{"text":"Waterfront landscapes"},{"text":"Institutional landscapes"},{"text":"Residential landscapes"},{"text":"Urban forests"},{"text":"Pedestrian environments"},{"text":"Stormwater landscapes"},{"text":"Landscape restoration"},{"text":"Climate-resilient public spaces"},{"text":"Landscape documentation and construction coordination"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A B.Arch graduate can build toward landscape-design roles, but professional landscape architect titles/practice rights may depend on the applicable qualification and regulations in the jurisdiction. For advanced professional practice, the current requirements of the relevant professional bodies should be checked."},{"type":"h","text":"Career Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Architectural Design + Site Planning","Landscape Design Fundamentals","Planting + Ecology + Grading","Urban Design + Public Realm","CAD + GIS + 3D Visualization","Landscape Documentation + Constr